    {
      "start": 20.65927153846154,
      "end": 23.375858615384615,
      "narration_en": "The gas splits the cover along a hidden seam",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f6d9b7b7576cd19466efdeb6cb08a8dec16e8944bbb666a1f4dfc4c933d072f3"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.375858615384615,
      "end": 26.55677869230769,
      "narration_en": "and fills the folded bag in about thirty milliseconds.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "095f70e82ba49786ba474f0ca37f861b787d49e84d60ceb1f8a753c2b4538a33"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.55677869230769,
      "end": 29.130573769230768,
      "narration_en": "Here is the clever part. The bag has holes in it.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "dbfd6cf8524b39b9e8955096061e8a49aa04fba6e46c6ff1670b676f7a342754"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.130573769230768,
      "end": 32.001951846153844,
      "narration_en": "As your head sinks in the gas escapes through the vents",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ed7e23d906a9198afc64a63af0e1dea89852cc31932f1ecd7c70eb169425558d"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.001951846153844,
      "end": 35.456663923076924,
      "narration_en": "so the bag slows you down gently instead of bouncing you back.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2dfdce7373c3645b84ab9d1f062d7071dd1ef1ab502b40814d898a48c2f80208"
